id: sleek-design
name: Sleek Design
kind: crafting
categories: armor
slots: 1
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Half the Damage Reduction from this Armor, and out of the Apparel Penalty.
# What it does, for the Effects on its Item's sheet: its Effects line as printed, word for
# word, cut into one line to an effect, each opening with its tag as the rulebook writes one.
summary: >
  [Passive]: Halve the Damage Reduction gained from this Armor.

  [Passive]: This Armor does not count towards your Apparel Penalty.
text: >
  Sleek Design: Light and flexible, this armor allows for a freer range of motion, but provides
  less protection.
  –Apparel Category: Armor
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –Quality Slots: 1
  –Effects: Halve the Damage Reduction gained from this Armor. This Armor does not count towards
  your Apparel Penalty.

---

# The Armor Category's part multiplies its Damage Reduction by `$armorFactor` - a half, here - and
# the Apparel Penalty leaves this piece out, as it does Lightweight's.

[passive]
piece.armorDamageReduction *= 1/2;
piece.countsForPenalty = false;
